{"change_summary":"Finished the remaining provenance remediation in the current tree by updating `crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs` so legacy total-style parameter normalization for provenance display/range checks preserves non-finite raw values instead of silently clamping them to `0.0`. That closes the last gap in the already-landed amendment set: non-finite and inverted-range diagnostics now survive the legacy-unit normalization path, while the existing branch behavior for freeform preset-level confidence, normalized legacy display helpers, and process-preset support for death/microfauna defaults was revalidated.","outstanding_risks":["`ProcessParamsPreset::param_value()` still exposes raw stored values for legacy total-style parameters. Callers that bypass `ProcessParamsPreset::format_param()` / `check_ranges()` and call the generic provenance formatter directly can still present scientifically wrong legacy values.","Runtime legacy-parameter helpers in `tank_core` still clamp non-finite values to `0.0` for simulation safety. Provenance diagnostics now preserve non-finite inputs, so tooling should not assume the runtime and provenance paths use identical transforms.","The worktree still contains an unrelated untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory, which was left untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the current provenance/process-preset implementation against the pending amendments and confirmed the branch already contained the schema, validation, formatting, and code-defined-default plumbing from the earlier fixes, leaving only the non-finite normalization gap unresolved.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Updated `crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs` so provenance normalization for legacy total-style process parameters divides by the legacy reference volume/area without erasing `NaN`/`inf`, allowing the existing warning path to report non-finite values correctly after normalization.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Re-ran the focused provenance, preset-loading, and scenario-materialization test targets to verify the preserved non-finite diagnostics and the already-present legacy-normalization/default-provenance paths.","order":2,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo test -p tank_data --lib` passed: 16 tests passed, 0 failed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --lib provenance` passed: 11 provenance tests passed, 0 failed.","`cargo test -p tank_scenarios --lib` passed: 3 tests passed, 0 failed.","`git diff --stat` shows the remaining source delta for this turn is limited to `crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs`.","`git status --short` shows the modified `crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs` plus unrelated untracked `.ralph-burning/` only."]}